 "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.03, 0.078, 0.61, 0.151], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Часть 1. Жизненный цикл запроса"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.794, 0.068, 0.975, 0.152], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "VITMO"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.083, 0.454, 0.179, 0.513], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Вопрос"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.083, 0.52, 0.52, 0.581], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Мы пишем только функцию-обработчик."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.081, 0.598, 0.553, 0.817], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Кто принимает соединение, разбирает HTTP, вызывает наш код и превращает результат в ответ? И чем в этом отличаются Flask, Django и FastAPI?"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 3, "blocks": [{"type": "image", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.399, 0.348, 0.453, 0.401], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.399, 0.348, 0.453, 0.401], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.031, 0.076, 0.396, 0.155], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Сервер ̸= фреймворк"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "header", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.795, 0.017, 0.98, 0.15], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "страница 4/50 IiTMO"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.074, 0.351, 0.322, 0.41], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "WSGI — синхронный"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.074, 0.415, 0.406, 0.519], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Фреймворки:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Flask, Django / DRF "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Серверы:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " gunicorn, waitress"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.073, 0.532, 0.412, 0.697], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Приложение — обычная функция: app(environ, start_response)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.073, 0.709, 0.439, 0.81], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Один вызов = один запрос от начала до конца."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.548, 0.351, 0.802, 0.41], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "ASGI — асинхронный"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.872, 0.348, 0.926, 0.401], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.872, 0.348, 0.926, 0.401], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.548, 0.415, 0.856, 0.52], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Фреймворки:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " FastAPI, Starlette "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Серверы:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " uvicorn, hypercorn"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.546, 0.532, 0.884, 0.695], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Приложение — корутина: async app(scope, receive, send)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.546, 0.708, 0.807, 0.812], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Пока запрос ждёт, сервер обслуживает другие."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.075, 0.908, 0.86, 1.0], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "app.run() во Flask и runserver в Django — серверы только для разработки, в продакшене их заменяют gunicorn или waitress"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 4, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.862, 0.018, 0.979, 0.054], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "страница 5/50"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.03, 0.078, 0.608, 0.152], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "WSGI: приложение — это функция"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "header", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.796, 0.052, 0.976, 0.147], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "viTMO"}]}, {"type": "code", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.075, 0.398, 0.513, 0.633], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.075, 0.398, 0.513, 0.633], "content": "def app(environ, start_response):\n    method = environ[\"REQUEST_METHOD\"]\n    path = environ[\"PATH_INFO\"]\n    start_response(\"200 OK\",\n        [(\"Content-Type\", \"text/plain\")])\n    return [f\"{method} {path}\".encode()]"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "python"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.048, 0.709, 0.46, 0.798], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "waitress-serve module:app — и это уже работающий сервер"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.048, 0.818, 0.458, 0.962], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Flask(__name__) и Django — такие же функции, внутри них роутинг, request, валидация."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.594, 0.309, 0.948, 0.405], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. Сервер принимает соединение и разбирает HTTP"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.595, 0.427, 0.95, 0.523], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. Кладёт запрос в словарь environ: метод, путь, заголовки"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.595, 0.543, 0.833, 0.594], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3. Вызывает app(...)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.594, 0.614, 0.917, 0.707], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4. Приложение возвращает код, заголовки и тело"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.594, 0.731, 0.87, 0.779], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5. Сервер отправляет ответ"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.574, 0.824, 0.941, 0.921], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Вызов "}, {"type": "text", "content": "синхронный", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ": пока обработчик ждёт базу, поток занят."}]}]}, {"page_idx": 5, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.862, 0.018, 0.979, 0.054], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "страница 6/50"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.031, 0.079, 0.607, 0.152], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "ASGI: приложение — это корутина"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "header", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.796, 0.052, 0.975, 0.147], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "viTMO"}]}, {"type": "code", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.076, 0.413, 0.568, 0.762], "content": [{"type": "code_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.076, 0.413, 0.568, 0.762], "content": "async def app(scope, receive, send):\n    if scope[\"type\"] != \"http\":\n        return\n    await send({\"type\": \"http.response.start\",\n            \"status\": 200,\n            \"headers\": [(b\"content-type\",\n                    b\"text/plain\")]})\n    await send({\"type\": \"http.response.body\",\n            \"body\": b\"hello\"})"}], "sub_type": "code", "guess_lang": "python"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.048, 0.836, 0.271, 0.882], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "uvicorn module:app"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.663, 0.316, 0.922, 0.398], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "∙ scope — данные запроса, как environ"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.663, 0.416, 0.944, 0.544], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "∙ receive / send — получить запрос и отправить ответ, кусками"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.663, 0.559, 0.947, 0.69], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "∙ Каждый await — точка, где сервер может переключиться на другой запрос"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.663, 0.704, 0.936, 0.834], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "∙ Умеет WebSocket и долгие соединения — в WSGI их не сделать"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.663, 0.848, 0.948, 0.935], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "∙ FastAPI построен на Starlette, а это ASGI-приложение"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 6, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.862, 0.017, 0.98, 0.054], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "страница 7/50"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.031, 0.08, 0.401, 0.151], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Серверы: кто есть кто"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.796, 0.052, 0.976, 0.148], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "viTMO"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.064, 0.348, 0.933, 0.828], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.064, 0.348, 0.933, 0.828], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Протокол</td><td>Как держит запросы</td></tr><tr><td>flask run, runserver</td><td>WSGI</td><td>поток на запрос</td></tr><tr><td>gunicorn</td><td>WSGI, ASGI черезuvicorn-worker</td><td>процессы, в каждом 1 или Nпотоков</td></tr><tr><td>waitress</td><td>WSGI</td><td>один процесс, пул потоков (4 поумолчанию)</td></tr><tr><td>uvicorn</td><td>ASGI</td><td>event loop, процессы через--workers</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 7, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.862, 0.017, 0.98, 0.054], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "страница 8/50"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.031, 0.08, 0.492, 0.152], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Чем запускать приложение"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "header", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.796, 0.052, 0.976, 0.148], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "viTMO"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.082, 0.362, 0.377, 0.444], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "flask --app app run --debug waitress-serve app:app"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.081, 0.475, 0.503, 0.557], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "python manage.py runserver waitress-serve project.wsgi:application"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.081, 0.584, 0.357, 0.667], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "uvicorn main:app --reload uvicorn main:app"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.557, 0.362, 0.703, 0.444], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "# Flask, dev # Flask, prod"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.557, 0.474, 0.682, 0.556], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "# DRF, dev # DRF, prod"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.556, 0.585, 0.725, 0.667], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "# FastAPI, dev # FastAPI, prod"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.076, 0.821, 0.708, 0.917], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Данные в памяти или в JSON-файле — запускайте "}, {"type": "text", "content": "один", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " процесс, без -w и --workers (часть 2)"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 8, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.862, 0.017, 0.98, 0.054], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "страница 9/50"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.03, 0.078, 0.4, 0.152], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Путь запроса во Flask"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "header", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.796, 0.052, 0.976, 0.148], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "viTMO"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.73, 0.307, 0.869, 0.347], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "не нашли → 404"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.11, 0.367, 0.889, 0.712], "content": [{"type": "image_caption", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.118, 0.858, 0.879, 0.907], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Flask — минимальный фреймворк: валидацию и формат ошибок пишем сами."}]}, {"type": "image_body", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.11, 0.367, 0.889, 0.712], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.72, 0.746, 0.879, 0.786], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "исключение → 500"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 9, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.796, 0.017, 0.979, 0.148], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "страница 10/50 viTMO"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.029, 0.076, 0.695, 0.152], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Путь запроса в Django REST Framework"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "image", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.14, 0.302, 0.859, 0.719], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.14, 0.302, 0.859, 0.719], "content": ""}, {"type": "image_footnote", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.529, 0.75, 0.651, 0.788], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "ошибка → 400"}]}, {"type": "image_footnote", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.076, 0.86, 0.921, 0.911], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Django — «всё включено»: ORM, админка, миграции. DRF добавляет к нему REST-слой."}]}]}]}], "is_full_document": false, "schema": "docvortex.middle", "schema_version": "2.0"}